{"version":1,"content":"<p>天主教海門教區丁祖耀主教祝聖典禮今日（15日）在江蘇省南通市青年東路天主堂舉行。</p><p>40歲的丁祖耀是內地最年輕的主教，刷新了42歲的新任赤峰教區主教常彥峰的最年輕記錄。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:20:39.029059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T13:51:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:57:50.814252+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T14:17:49.255223+00:00","content_hash":"e65833bc7ce6f0c98c23fe2b83147b3e3820dbdd60e73e6a63105c586fee84f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}